# Academy UI

Before any frontend change:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/academy-design/SKILL.md` and its `references/`.
2. Inspect the listed gold-standard files — copy patterns, not invent.
3. Prefer existing primitives (`ca-*`, `container-wide`, `font-heading`, `CourseCard`, `CaPageHeader`, admin `PageHeader`).
4. Use design tokens (`--ca-navy-*`, `--ca-gold*`, `--ca-slate-*`, `--ink`, `--primary`). Never invent one-off hex when a token exists.
5. Preserve visual continuity with CA / courses / home-v2 — not a generic ecommerce template.
6. Validate 375 / 390 / 430 and desktop. Sticky mobile CTAs must not cover content without `pb-*`.
7. Motion: restrained; respect `prefers-reduced-motion` / `motion-reduce:`.

## Forbidden looks

Purple SaaS gradients · cream+#terracotta AI cluster · newspaper broadsheet · glow spam · cards-in-cards · fake urgency · stock Shopify chrome · default unmodified shadcn aesthetic as brand.

## Premium means

Restraint, hierarchy, spacing, typography, polish, trustworthy CTAs, intentional empty/loading/error states.
